# Witherbloom Command, modes 2 and 3: Bot1 destroys Bot2's Mind Stone (mana value 2, the limit) and gives Bot2's Woodland Changeling
# -3/-1 until end of turn. Refused as the destroy target: Bot1's own Crucible of Worlds (mana value 3, one past the limit) and
# the Woodland Changeling (a creature, with mana value 2). The Mongrel (2/2) ends at -1/1, which a -2 or -2/-2 would not match, and is
# back at 2/2 on the next turn (CR 514.2: until end of turn). Bot1's pool is checked empty right after the cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Witherbloom Command
Crucible of Worlds
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mind Stone
Woodland Changeling
Island x12

